Multivenue Trading Engine — Copyright 2026 Anton (darkcite) — is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see `LICENSE` and `NOTICE`).

This file lists the third-party packages linked into a **distributed
binary** of this project and reproduces their license texts, as those
licenses require. It is generated by `cargo about` from the resolved
dependency graph for the shipped targets (`aarch64-apple-darwin`,
`x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu`). Build-time and dev-only dependencies are
excluded because they are not present in the binary.

No third-party source is vendored in this repository; these packages are
resolved from crates.io at build time.

**This file must ship alongside `LICENSE` and `NOTICE` with any binary
distribution of this software.**

